  "description": "<p>This task is to remove the accordion for each \"Historic Version\" listed on the /fcr:versions page for a resource.<br/>\nCurrently, there is a `+` that opens an empty accordion panel.</p>\n\n<p>To reproduce in the HTML UI:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>create a resource</li>\n\t<li>create a version of the resource</li>\n\t<li>view the mementos</li>\n\t<li>Observe the empty accordion panel for the newly created memento.</li>\n</ul>\n",
